{"title": "Written Off Too Soon", "type": "Chart twist", "hooks": ["From 98 to 60. You'd call it finished. You'd be wrong.", "It fell from 98 to 60. Then it did the opposite.", "You'd have sold this at 60. Watch what it did next."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "From 98 to 60. You'd call it finished. You'd be wrong.", "text": "Looked finished. It wasn't.", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The drop", "show": 62, "vo": "Look at the drop. From about 98 down to about 60, in under twenty candles. Most people would write this chart off.", "cues": [{"say": "about 98", "do": "mark", "i": 40, "label": "A", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "about 60", "do": "mark", "i": 59, "label": "B", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "in under twenty candles", "do": "shade", "from": 40, "to": 59, "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Back at the level", "show": 62, "vo": "But it climbed back. Now the price is pressing on resistance, right where sellers turned it before.", "cues": [{"say": "it climbed back", "do": "reveal", "to": 90}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Hold or break?", "vo": "So does the level hold and turn it down? Or does it break and keep going?", "win": [20, 115], "options": ["It holds: the price turns down from the resistance", "It breaks: the price closes through the resistance and keeps going"], "answer": 1, "show": 90, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 88.01, "label": "Resistance", "tone": "level"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "It broke through", "vo": "It broke. The price closed through resistance and stayed there. Twenty-five candles later, it was up 7.7 percent.", "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "mark", "i": 81, "label": "Sw", "side": "high"}], "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Check before the test", "vo": "The clue comes before the test. Count how often the level turned the price. Check which way the trend runs. Watch whether volume grows into it.", "items": [{"text": "Count the touches", "sub": "How often it turned price", "icon": "chart"}, {"text": "Read the trend", "sub": "Which way it runs", "icon": "up"}, {"text": "Watch the volume", "sub": "Growing into the level", "icon": "bolt"}], "cues": [{"say": "Count how often", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "which way the trend runs", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "whether volume grows", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Every trade needs a stop", "vo": "Levels break often enough that every trade needs a stop. Follow, and practise free at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "It fell from 98 to 60, then broke straight through resistance.\n\nMost people wrote this chart off after the drop.\nThe price came back to the level and closed through it.\n25 candles later it was up 7.7%.\nCount the touches, read the trend, watch the volume.\n\nSave this for your next resistance test.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #ChartReading #Resistance #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[86.0, 86.31, 83.57, 85.41, 5864256], [85.57, 86.41, 83.09, 84.17, 5343149], [84.15, 84.81, 82.89, 84.67, 2839919], [84.67, 84.87, 84.41, 84.65, 1135872], [84.65, 85.38, 84.06, 84.22, 2880437], [84.24, 84.68, 84.11, 84.44, 1504557], [84.43, 84.91, 82.67, 83.4, 3163301], [83.45, 85.09, 83.23, 84.94, 1771087], [84.93, 85.95, 84.08, 85.95, 1902956], [85.99, 88.35, 85.74, 87.59, 1859877], [87.58, 89.53, 87.52, 87.76, 2627996], [87.76, 88.06, 87.05, 87.7, 2777500], [87.7, 87.71, 85.39, 86.53, 4149137], [86.55, 87.11, 85.11, 85.2, 4957093], [85.19, 86.99, 84.32, 85.96, 7830421], [85.96, 86.04, 78.18, 79.42, 9821180], [79.45, 80.04, 75.96, 79.27, 19457394], [79.32, 80.18, 79.25, 80.09, 3899617], [80.1, 81.52, 79.72, 81.45, 2608000], [81.48, 84.95, 81.14, 84.95, 1942815], [84.95, 88.53,